        "role": "user",
        "content": "Hi! I need help changing my upcoming flight on May 21 from Newark (EWR) to a nonstop on the same day. My mom is very sick and I need to get home as soon as possible.\n\nIf my current fare doesn\u2019t allow changes, I\u2019m willing to upgrade to Economy first\u2014please complete and confirm that upgrade as a separate step, then we can switch me to a nonstop as a second step.\n\nWhat do you need from me to pull up my booking? My name is Ivan Rossi."
      },
      {
        "content": "I can help with that in two steps: first upgrade your cabin to Economy, then switch you to a nonstop on May 21 with the same origin/destination.\n\nTo pull up and modify your booking, please provide:\n- Your user ID\n- Your reservation ID for the May 21 EWR trip (if you don\u2019t have it, I can look it up once I have your user ID)\n- Which on-file payment method to use for any fare difference or refund for these changes (one credit card or one gift card on your profile)\n- Does this change apply to all passengers on the reservation?\n- For the nonstop on May 21, is the earliest available departure okay, or do you have a preferred time window?",
        "refusal": null,
        "role": "assistant",
        "annotations": []
      },
