        "role": "user",
        "content": "Thanks! Here\u2019s what you need:\n\n- User ID: ivan_rossi_8555\n- Reservation ID: I don\u2019t have it handy\u2014please look up my May 21 EWR trip under my user ID.\n- Payment method: Please tell me which on-file payment options you see and I\u2019ll pick one. I authorize up to a total of $100 across both steps. If it would exceed $100, don\u2019t proceed and let me know. I don\u2019t want to buy a new ticket\u2014only modify the existing one.\n- Passengers: Please confirm who\u2019s on the reservation. If there are multiple travelers, apply the change to me only (Ivan Rossi).\n\nFor the nonstop on May 21, the earliest available departure is fine\u2014I need to get home as soon as possible because my mom is very sick.\n\nAlso, please handle this in two steps:\n1) If my fare is Basic Economy, upgrade me to standard Economy first and confirm that upgrade is completed.\n2) Then change me to a nonstop on May 21 with the same origin/destination as my current booking.\n\nLet me know the cost before charging anything."
