harge for all three passengers, then Step 2 would issue refunds of $170 per passenger ($510 total), resulting in a net refund overall\u2014but Step 1 by itself exceeds your $100 authorization.\n\nIf you choose to proceed (either via human split or for all passengers), please also:\n- Confirm which single on-file payment method to use for any charges/refunds (Visa 1777, gift_card_7344518, or gift_card_9823297).\n- Confirm you want the nonstop HAT041 (07:00 departure) on May 21.\n\nNothing will be changed until you confirm.",
