        "content": "Thanks, Mohamed.\n\nHere\u2019s what I found on your profile:\n- MasterCard on file: ending 9363\n- Total gift card balance: $327 (combined)\n- Total travel certificate balance: $1,000 (combined)\n\nImportant constraint for your current ticket:\n- Your existing reservation K1NW8N is in basic economy. Basic economy flights cannot be changed to different flights. We can only upgrade the cabin on the same flights. To switch to a different business-class itinerary on the same dates, we\u2019d need to cancel and rebook.\n\nTwo quotes as requested\n\n1) Change existing ticket (same flights, upgrade to business; one payment method only for the difference)\n- Flights kept: HAT023 (JFK\u2192SFO 5/26), HAT204 (SFO\u2192SEA 5/28), HAT021 (SEA\u2192JFK 5/28)\n- New business fare (per passenger): 364 + 248 + 453 = $1,065\n- Total for 3 passengers: $3,195\n- You paid: $567 (gift card)\n- Charge to MasterCard 9363 (certificates can\u2019t be used for changes): $3,195 \u2212 $567 = $2,628\n\n2) Cancel and rebook new business-class round trip on the same dates (apply 1 certificate, then gift cards, then MasterCard)\n- Cancellation: Booking was created on 2024-05-14 16:03 ET, so we\u2019re within 24 hours. No cancellation fee. Your $567 will be refunded to the original gift card (5\u20137 business days; not available for the new booking immediately).\n- Cheapest available business itinerary for 3 passengers on your dates:\n  - Outbound Sun 5/26: HAT023 JFK\u2192SFO (business) \u2014 $364 pp\n  - Return Tue 5/28: HAT204 SFO\u2192SEA (business) $248 pp + HAT100 SEA\u2192JFK (business) $259 pp = $507 pp\n  - Total: $871 pp \u00d7 3 = $2,613\n- Payment application limits: at most 1 certificate + up to 3 gift cards + 1 credit card.\n- MasterCard impact examples (using both gift cards: $327 total):\n  - If we use the $500 certificate (ID: certificate_3765853): $2,613 \u2212 $500 \u2212 $327 = $1,786 to MasterCard 9363\n  - If we use a $250 certificate (ID: certificate_9984806 or certificate_2765295): $2,613 \u2212 $250 \u2212 $327 = $2,036 to MasterCard 9363\n\nWhat I need from you to proceed\n- Which option do you choose: 1) Upgrade same flights to business, or 2) Cancel and rebook the cheapest business itinerary above?\n- If you choose option 2, which single certificate should I apply: $500 (certificate_3765853) or $250 (certificate_9984806 or certificate_2765295)?\n- Please confirm the cancellation reason as \u201cchange of plan\u201d (for option 2).\n- Please confirm passengers remain the same as on K1NW8N: Mohamed Silva (1960-11-26), Raj Sanchez (1986-09-12), and Liam Wilson (1980-03-27).\n- Confirm zero checked bags and no insurance.\n\nOnce you confirm, I\u2019ll list the action details one more time and then proceed.",
