        "content": "Thanks for the detailed breakdown\u2014that\u2019s very helpful.\n\nI choose option 2: please cancel and rebook on the cheapest business-class itinerary you listed for the same dates.\n\nGiven the one-certificate-per-booking rule, here\u2019s my plan to minimize the MasterCard charge:\n- Rebook as three separate reservations (same flights/dates), so we can use all three certificates.\n- Apply:\n  - Reservation 1 (Traveler A): $500 certificate (certificate_3765853) + all gift cards ($327 total), then MasterCard 9363 for the remainder.\n  - Reservation 2 (Traveler B): $250 certificate (certificate_9984806), then MasterCard 9363 for the remainder.\n  - Reservation 3 (Traveler C): $250 certificate (certificate_2765295), then MasterCard 9363 for the remainder.\n\nUsing your quoted fare of $871 per person:\n- Res 1 MC charge: $871 \u2212 $500 \u2212 $327 = $44\n- Res 2 MC charge: $871 \u2212 $250 = $621\n- Res 3 MC charge: $871 \u2212 $250 = $621\n- Total MasterCard impact: $1,286\n\nPlease confirm:\n- The per-person fare will remain $871 when booked as three separate reservations on the same flights/dates.\n- The total MasterCard charge will be $1,286 as above.\n- The $567 from K1NW8N will be refunded back to the original gift card and isn\u2019t available for the new bookings.\n\nIf confirmed, proceed as follows:\n- Cancel K1NW8N with reason \u201cchange of plan.\u201d\n- Rebook three separate reservations on:\n  - Outbound Sun 5/26: HAT023 JFK\u2192SFO (business)\n  - Return Tue 5/28: HAT204 SFO\u2192SEA (business) + HAT100 SEA\u2192JFK (business)\n- No checked bags and no insurance.\n- Use MasterCard ending 9363 for any remainder after applying the specified certificates/gift cards.\n\nBefore you issue tickets, please read back:\n- The final per-reservation totals and the exact MasterCard charge per reservation and in total.\n- The passenger details you need for each of the three reservations, and I\u2019ll provide them right away.\n\nIf availability or pricing changes when splitting into three bookings, please pause and share the updated amounts before proceeding."
