        "content": "Hi. I need to cancel my flight immediately due to a family emergency. I\u2019m really upset and I need this handled right now. I want a full refund given the circumstances, and I do not want to be transferred to another agent\u2014please take care of this here.\n\nWhat do you need from me to pull up my reservation? I have my booking details ready."
