        "content": "I\u2019m very sorry about your family emergency.\n\nI\u2019ve pulled up your reservation and confirmed:\n- Reservation: PEP4E0, user sophia_taylor_9065\n- Trip: One-way CLT \u2192 PHX on 2024-05-20 (via DTW: HAT176 CLT\u2192DTW, HAT097 DTW\u2192PHX)\n- Cabin: Basic economy\n- Insurance: No\n- Booking date: 2024-05-05 (more than 24 hours ago)\n- Airline status: Both flights are not cancelled\n\nPer our policy, a cancellation with refund is only allowed if at least one of these is true: booked within the last 24 hours, airline cancelled the flight, business cabin, or you have travel insurance for a covered reason. None of these apply here, so I\u2019m not permitted to cancel or issue a refund for this basic economy ticket.\n\nIf you\u2019d like me to escalate to a human agent to review any possible exceptions, say the word and I\u2019ll transfer you immediately. Otherwise, let me know if there\u2019s anything else I can help with.",
