        "content": "I\u2019m truly sorry you\u2019re going through this. I\u2019ve double\u2011checked your reservation details:\n\n- Reservation PEP4E0 (user sophia_taylor_9065)\n- One\u2011way CLT \u2192 PHX on 2024\u201105\u201120 via DTW (HAT176, HAT097)\n- Cabin: Basic economy\n- Insurance: No\n- Booked: 2024\u201105\u201105\n- Airline has not cancelled the flights\n\nI understand your request, but I\u2019m not authorized to grant exceptions, apply bereavement/compassionate waivers, override policies, or waive fare differences. Under our rules, I can\u2019t process a refund or modify a basic economy ticket in this scenario. I will not cancel your ticket.\n\nIf you want to travel on May 22, I can book a new one\u2011way CLT \u2192 PHX ticket for that date and keep your current reservation unchanged. To move forward quickly, please confirm:\n\n- Cabin class: basic economy, economy, or business\n- Passenger: use the same details (Sophia Taylor, DOB 1999\u201105\u201127)? Yes/No\n- Checked bags: how many? (0 if none)\n- Travel insurance for the new ticket: yes or no ($30 per passenger)\n- Payment method: which stored method in your profile should I use? (e.g., the same credit card used on your current booking)\n\nOnce I have this, I\u2019ll search May 22 options and, before booking, summarize the selection and total price for your approval.",
