e to proceed with the best-priced option above ($1,938 additional) and are okay departing outside 08:00\u201320:00 on May 24, I can process the date change and full-reservation upgrade together. Please confirm:\n1) Proceed with outbound HAT190 + HAT047 on May 24 and return HAT089 on May 26 + HAT279 on May 27, all in business.\n2) Choose one payment method for the additional amount:\n   - credit_card_7434610 (Mastercard \u2022\u2022\u2022\u20229448)\n   - credit_card_7231150 (Visa \u2022\u2022\u2022\u20223422)\n   - gift_card_7194529 ($62 balance; note this balance is less than the amount due, so it would not cover the charge)\n\nIf you prefer not to proceed at this price, I can:\n- Monitor for fare changes and alert you if business drops below a target, or\n- Quote economy options for the May 24 date change (no upgrade), if that helps your plans."
